1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,000
Hello?
Xin chào?

2
00:00:01,000 --> 00:00:13,919
Hello. It's Detective Lily Barnes here.
Xin chào. Thám tử Lily Barnes đây.

3
00:00:13,919 --> 00:00:19,519
Hello Lily. So, where were they on Saturday?
Xin chào Lily. Vậy, thứ Bảy họ ở đâu?

4
00:00:19,519 --> 00:00:22,359
Well, first Fred.
À, đầu tiên là Fred.

5
00:00:22,359 --> 00:00:27,320
OK. Fred. Where was he?
Được. Fred. Anh ấy ở đâu?

6
00:00:27,320 --> 00:00:29,920
He was at the swimming pool.
Anh ấy ở bể bơi.

7
00:00:29,920 --> 00:00:35,000
So, Fred was at the swimming pool.
Vậy, Fred ở bể bơi.

8
00:00:38,840 --> 00:00:40,840
Who's next?
Tiếp theo là ai?

9
00:00:40,840 --> 00:00:42,600
Paul.
Paul.

10
00:00:42,600 --> 00:00:47,400
OK. So, where was Paul?
Được. Vậy, Paul ở đâu?

11
00:00:47,400 --> 00:00:50,920
He was at the shopping centre.
Anh ấy ở trung tâm mua sắm.

12
00:00:50,920 --> 00:00:55,240
At the shopping centre? OK.
Ở trung tâm mua sắm à? Được.

13
00:00:58,320 --> 00:01:01,320
And who's next?
Và tiếp theo là ai?

14
00:01:01,320 --> 00:01:07,319
Next is Vicki. She was at the train station.
Tiếp theo là Vicki. Cô ấy ở ga tàu.

15
00:01:07,319 --> 00:01:12,319
At the train station, eh? OK.
Ở ga tàu à? Được.

16
00:01:12,319 --> 00:01:21,319
Vicki was at the train station.
Vicki ở ga tàu.

17
00:01:21,319 --> 00:01:26,319
And John? Where was he?
Còn John? Anh ấy ở đâu?

18
00:01:26,319 --> 00:01:32,319
John? Well, he was shopping at the supermarket.
John à? À, anh ấy đang mua sắm ở siêu thị.

19
00:01:32,319 --> 00:01:38,319
John was at the supermarket. OK.
John ở siêu thị. Được.

20
00:01:41,319 --> 00:01:43,319
Is that everyone?
Hết mọi người chưa?

21
00:01:43,319 --> 00:01:49,319
No. There's one more woman. Sarah.
Chưa. Còn một phụ nữ nữa. Sarah.

22
00:01:49,319 --> 00:01:53,319
OK. Where was Sarah?
Được. Sarah ở đâu?

23
00:01:53,319 --> 00:01:57,319
She was at the library.
Cô ấy ở thư viện.

24
00:01:57,319 --> 00:02:01,319
At the library. OK.
Ở thư viện. Được.

25
00:02:03,319 --> 00:02:08,319
I'm going to send you an email with their photos now.
Bây giờ tôi sẽ gửi cho bạn email có ảnh của họ.

26
00:02:08,319 --> 00:02:15,319
OK. Thank you, Lily. You're a very good detective.
Được. Cảm ơn, Lily. Bạn là một thám tử rất giỏi.
